From: Tim 'mithro' Ansell <me@mith.ro>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 16:09:11 +0930
Subject: [PATCH 02/32] spiFlash: add display_info(), unique ID and SFDP read

display_info() reports manufacturer, part, size (database, then SFDP,
then JEDEC capacity byte), the factory unique ID and SFDP content.

Unique ID read is vendor specific and only attempted, with read-only
commands, for known vendors/families: Winbond/GigaDevice/ISSI/Puya
(0x4B), Micron N25Q/MT25Q (extended 0x9F), Infineon S25FL-L (0x4C)
and SST26 (0x88).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F2L6L5SJYvbBUUt4DinjGC
---
 src/spiFlash.cpp | 181 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/spiFlash.hpp |  25 +++++++
 2 files changed, 206 insertions(+)

